  "scope": "Equivalence only for Speed/action order under supplied HP/status/grounding/Unburden and other activation state; no claim of identical complete battle behavior.",
  "limitations": [
    "Compatible Mega stones stay separate to preserve form/training correlations.",
    "Indirect effects via item loss, HP, status, grounding, switching or ability activation must be evidenced or enumerated separately.",
    "No independent in-game Champions timing/rounding certification."
  ],
